like? What are families like rather than what could they be or what should they be? And I imagine a lot of it has to be driven by the fear that people are going to look at you and say, well, you must have been a bad parent or you were a crummy sister and that's why you're not in touch with each other anymore, right? Yeah, I think those are things, those kinds of judgments are experienced, really commonly by people who are estranged from a family member. And as well, I think we are all entitled to privacy about our family relationships as well. So some of those causes of family estrangement, like abuse in a relationship, are not things
你会想告诉你的同事，甚至可能是朋友或伴侣的事情。就像其中一些经历对我们来说是如此私密。并且我们在那种方式上并不欠任何人我们内心最深处的部分，尤其是在没有安全的交往关系来进行那种自我表露的情况下。所以我想到了所有那些我曾交谈过的人，他们在办公室里会说，他们只是编造了一个关于他们在节假日做什么的故事，或者当人们问起他们的家庭以及他们在一起做什么时，他们会准备好一两句排练好的台词。我想我听过太多次了，

