We hear mostly from women. We hear less about experiences of estrangement by men. There's all sorts of ways, I think, in which it's really important. that estrangement research reflects the diversity of people's experiences. Dr. Blake, I want to thank you for joining me today, and I wish you luck in your research. This is a very important topic. Thank you. Thank you for having me. It's always a pleasure to talk about this topic. Thank you. You can learn more about Dr. Blake's and other psychologists research on family estrangement.
